{%- comment -%}
The IG Publisher's page footer on the IG site's own pages (#1901): the <prev | top | next> row, the band naming
the IG's publisher, package, FHIR version and build date, and the "Links:" row.
Reads `site.data.fhir.footer` (`igSiteFooter` in `ig-footer.ts`: every value from the IG's own package and
`sushi-config.yaml`, and `links` already narrowed to targets this site holds) and the page's `ig_prev` /
`ig_next` (`build-ig-site.ts`, in the IG's table-of-contents order). A value the data does not carry is left
out of the sentence, never filled in.
The IG's artefact pages (`gen-ig-pages.ts`) are drawn by THIS include too, not by a footer of their own: they
set `ig_footer`, their `ig_prev` / `ig_next` in the artefacts' reading order, and `ig_root`, the way up from
the page to the site root. `ig_root` goes before every on-site href in `site.data.fhir.footer` (the
stylesheets, `toc.html`), which are written once, relative to the root; a page at the root sets none.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign f = site.data.fhir.footer -%}
{%- assign up = page.ig_root | default: "" -%}
{%- for css in f.stylesheets %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ up }}{{ css }}">{% endfor %}
<footer id="ig-footer"{% if f.scope %} class="{{ f.scope }}"{% endif %}>
<p class="ig-footer-nav">{% if page.ig_prev %}<a href="{{ page.ig_prev }}">&lt;prev</a> | {% endif %}<a href="#">top</a>{% if page.ig_next %} | <a href="{{ page.ig_next }}">next&gt;</a>{% endif %}</p>
<p class="ig-footer-band">
{%- if f.publisher %}IG ©{% if f.copyrightYear %} {{ f.copyrightYear | escape }}{% endif %} {% if f.publisherUrl %}<a href="{{ f.publisherUrl }}" rel="external">{{ f.publisher | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ f.publisher | escape }}{% endif %}. {% endif -%}
{%- if f.packageId %}Package <code>{{ f.packageId | escape }}{% if f.version %}#{{ f.version | escape }}{% endif %}</code>{% if f.fhirVersion %} based on {% if f.fhirUrl %}<a href="{{ f.fhirUrl }}" rel="external">FHIR {{ f.fhirVersion | escape }}</a>{% else %}FHIR {{ f.fhirVersion | escape }}{% endif %}{% endif %}. {% endif -%}
{%- if f.generated %}Generated {{ f.generated | escape }}{% endif -%}
</p>
{%- if f.links.first %}
<p class="ig-footer-links">Links: {% for l in f.links %}{% unless forloop.first %} | {% endunless %}<a href="{% unless l.external %}{{ up }}{% endunless %}{{ l.href }}"{% if l.external %} rel="external"{% endif %}>{{ l.label | escape }}</a>{% endfor %}</p>
{%- endif %}
</footer>
